/h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">المفسرون من السلف ومن بعدهم</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «لا تعط عطاء تطلب أكثر منه، وهو أن تهدي ليهدى إليك أكثر من هديتك.»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 3/136</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s74a6\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/74-4.html\">Önceki âyet (74:4)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/74-31.html\">Sonraki âyet (74:31)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/74-31.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Al-Muddaththir 74:31 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Biz; kendilerine kitap verilenler kesin bir bilgiyle inansın, iman edenlerin imanları artsın, kendilerine kitap verilenler ile iman edenler şüpheye kapılma\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/74-31.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Al-Muddaththir 74:31 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Biz; kendilerine kitap verilenler kesin bir bilgiyle inansın, iman edenlerin imanları artsın, kendilerine kitap verilenler ile iman edenler şüpheye kapılma\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Al-Muddaththir\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/74.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 31\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/74-31.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/74.html\">Sûre Al-Muddaththir</a> › Âyet 31</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Al-Muddaththir 74:31</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا جَعَلْنَا أَصْحَابَ النَّارِ إِلَّا مَلَائِكَةً وَمَا جَعَلْنَا عِدَّتَهُمْ إِلَّا فِتْنَةً لِّلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا لِيَسْتَيْقِنَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ وَيَزْدَادَ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا إِيمَانًا وَلَا يَرْتَابَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ وَالْمُؤْمِنُونَ وَلِيَقُولَ الَّذِينَ فِي قُلُوبِهِم مَّرَضٌ وَالْكَافِرُونَ مَاذَا أَرَادَ اللَّهُ بِهَٰذَا مَثَلًا كَذَٰلِكَ يُضِلُّ اللَّهُ مَن يَشَاءُ وَيَهْدِي مَن يَشَاءُ وَمَا يَعْلَمُ جُنُودَ رَبِّكَ إِلَّا هُوَ وَمَا هِيَ إِلَّا ذِكْرَىٰ لِلْبَشَرِ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Biz; kendilerine kitap verilenler kesin bir bilgiyle inansın, iman edenlerin imanları artsın, kendilerine kitap verilenler ile iman edenler şüpheye kapılmasın, kalplerinde bir hastalık olanlar ile küfre sapanlar da, “Allah, bu örnekle (on dokuz sayısı ile) neyi anlatmak istedi?” desin diye o ateşin koruyucularını meleklerden başkasını kılmadık ve onların sayısını da kâfirler için yalnızca bir fitne/imtihan yaptık. Allah; dilediğini işte böyle saptırır, dilediğine de hidayet eder. Rabbinin ordularını kendisinden başkası bilemez. Bu, insanlar için bir öğütten başka bir şey değildir.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ومرض القلوب نوعان: مرض شبهة وشك، ومرض شهوة وغي، وكلاهما في القرآن.<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 4/5</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">قال تعالى في مرض الشبهة: {في قلوبهم مرض فزادهم الله مرضا} [البقرة: 10] [البقرة: 10] وقال تعالى: {وليقول الذين في قلوبهم مرض والكافرون ماذا أراد الله بهذا مثلا} [المدثر: 31] [المدثر: 31]<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 4/5</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s74a31\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/74-6.html\">Önceki âyet (74:6)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/74-38.html\">Sonraki âyet (74:38)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/74-38.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Al-Muddaththir 74:38 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Her nefis kazandığına karşılık bir rehindir.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/74-38.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/74-38.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/74-38.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/74-38.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafs